; File API equivalence test: cmake ref vs yelu output, compared via cmake File API.
; Requires cmake on PATH.
;
; Driven by `make file-api-test` (python3-direct from the repo root), NOT a dune
; alias: the harness needs an absolute path to the dune-built step exes under
; _build/, and a sandboxed dune action only sees a relative %{workspace_root},
; which resolves against the sandbox cwd and misses them. `make file-api-test`
; builds src/bin/{cmake,yelu}/{v1,v2}/ then runs run_file_api.py directly.
;
; Not attached to (alias runtest) — cmake is an external dep not guaranteed in CI.
